  <Index>k__BackingField: 20
  <Title>k__BackingField: Magma Works
  <Settings>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a4621c90bf8b4fb4f8d530d842f8c4a0, type: 2}
  description: On a volcanic world the Shadow forges its war machines over rivers of lava. Wreck the foundries and hunt the Foundry Crawler through the smoke.
  introduces: Heavy armour and lava lakes. The Foundry Crawler's vents fire walls of bolts.
  hints:
  - 'Bunkers and laser towers are worth a fortune: bring ground weapons.'
  - The crawler's cannon opens when its turrets and vents are gone.
